-- Rental only: NYC halls that don't present their own concerts (artists rent
-- them). Seeded 2026-11-16 from the research; set or removed by hand after.
update organizations set tags = array_append(tags, 'rental-only')
 where id in ('26042a6c-0dbd-4080-ba5f-9cc2d175d15c','5a4ae830-6193-4aff-8a61-1cd58cdb15c4','c98c06bf-713f-43f5-bd07-7d7e101196dc','2365616e-94bb-4a3c-8611-4388f5400023','1653a0f9-2ed8-42cf-bd0b-4387458921e1','d7da507f-c90e-4e1a-aae1-3d01e5182f34','383c230c-3b84-4043-a742-4781d8d0d2c1','8bb154cc-9309-4da3-b1f4-42e74d76c4fa','70499587-339e-4712-93d2-cf1000f00c65','7a4073e3-92bb-4970-baed-f687876b13c8','89d75b4a-304a-45c1-ab78-c4566b5a9dc2') and not ('rental-only' = any(tags));

comment on column organizations.tags is
  'Free tags. research-claude / research-chatgpt: added automatically (trigger organizations_profile_research) from profile.researchedBy; ChatGPT: do not add them by hand, set profile.researchedBy instead. nyc: added and removed automatically (trigger organizations_nyc_tag) when city is in New York City ("New York, NY", "Brooklyn, NY", "Bronx, NY", "Queens, NY", "Staten Island, NY", "Long Island City, NY", "Flushing, NY"...); ChatGPT: do not add it by hand, write the city as "<City>, NY" instead. NYC venues get no booking or fee pitch (we look for co-productions or venue use), so never queue a booking email for them. rental-only: the hall does not present its own concerts, artists rent it (no presenting series at all; a place that presents some series and also rents is NOT rental-only); ChatGPT may add it after checking the venue website, and never queue a booking email for these. nyc-under-5h: city at most about 5 hours by car from Midtown Manhattan (OSRM, no traffic, 2026-11-12), never on NYC organizations. chamber-specialist: presents mainly chamber music or recitals. prestigious: places the owner really wants to play; the owner adds or removes it by hand.';
